<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Browser Extension</h1>
<p>Shorten any page with one click, right from your browser toolbar.</p>

<h2>Features</h2>
<ul><li>One-click URL shortening from any web page</li><li>Choose workspace and domain</li><li>Copy short URL to clipboard instantly</li><li>View recent links</li><li>Generate QR codes</li></ul>

<h2>Installation</h2>
<h3>Chrome</h3>
<ol><li>Download the extension files from your UTMPro admin</li><li>Go to <code>chrome://extensions</code></li><li>Enable <strong>Developer Mode</strong></li><li>Click <strong>Load Unpacked</strong> and select the extension folder</li></ol>

<h3>Firefox</h3>
<ol><li>Go to <code>about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox</code></li><li>Click <strong>Load Temporary Add-on</strong></li><li>Select the <code>manifest.json</code> file</li></ol>

<h2>Configuration</h2>
<p>Click the extension icon → <strong>Options</strong> → Enter your UTMPro API key and select your default workspace.</p>
